а","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"city","pos":"","ru":"город (большой)","kk":"қала","def":"Almaty is a big city.","img":null,"icon":"<path d=\"M3.4 20.4V9.6l6-3.2v14M9.4 20.4V11l7.2-3.4v12.8M16.6 20.4V13l4 1.8v5.6\"/><path d=\"M2.4 20.4h19.2\"/>","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/2c54892c40a1.mp3"},{"en":"town","pos":"","ru":"город (небольшой)","kk":"шағын қала","def":"It's a small town.","img":null,"icon":"<rect x=\"5\" y=\"3.6\" width=\"14\" height=\"16.8\" rx=\"2.4\"/><path d=\"M9 7.6h2M13 7.6h2M9 11.6h2M13 11.6h2M9 15.6h6\"/>","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/0cd0b19231db.mp3"},{"en":"village","pos":"","ru":"деревня","kk":"ауыл","def":"My parents live in a village.","img":null,"icon":"<path d=\"M12 20.4v-6.8\"/><path d=\"M12 13.6c0-3.2 2.4-5.8 5.4-5.8 0 3.2-2.4 5.8-5.4 5.8z\"/><path d=\"M12 15.4c-3 0-5.4-2.6-5.4-5.8 3 0 5.4 2.6 5.4 5.8z\"/><path d=\"M7.4 20.4h9.2\"/>","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/3bdc3ec682bf.mp3"},{"en":"street","pos":"","ru":"улица","kk":"көше","def":"Our house is at number 36 Judson Street.","img":"/course/a0/img/l8-street.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/d3a9fb075d49.mp3"},{"en":"garden","pos":"","ru":"сад","kk":"бақ","def":"There isn't a garden.","img":null,"icon":"<path d=\"M12 20.4v-6.8\"/><path d=\"M12 13.6c0-3.2 2.4-5.8 5.4-5.8 0 3.2-2.4 5.8-5.4 5.8z\"/><path d=\"M12 15.4c-3 0-5.4-2.6-5.4-5.8 3 0 5.4 2.6 5.4 5.8z\"/><path d=\"M7.4 20.4h9.2\"/>","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/b1ade531057f.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Слова","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Almaty is a big","after":".","answers":["city"],"bank":["town","city","village"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Слова","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"I","after":"in a small flat.","answers":["live"],"bank":["study","work","live"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Слова","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"My parents live in a","after":".","answers":["village"],"bank":["city","village","street"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Грамматика","type":"phrases","title":"Послушайте два предложения.","sub":"Один предмет или больше?","items":[{"text":"There's a great bakery.","src":"/learning/audio/a0/b2d219564822.mp3"},{"text":"There are 4,000 people.","src":"/learning/audio/a0/9dd52876e98b.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Грамматика","type":"note","title":"there is / there are","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th></th><th>Один предмет</th><th>Два и больше</th></tr><tr><td>+</td><td>There's a theatre.</td><td>There are supermarkets.</td></tr><tr><td>–</td><td>There isn't a theatre.</td><td>There aren't any hotels.</td></tr><tr><td>?</td><td>Is there a car park?</td><td>Are there any towels?</td></tr></table><p><b>There's</b> — один предмет, <b>there are</b> — два и больше.</p><p>В вопросах и отрицаниях с множественным — <b>any</b>: aren't <b>any</b> hotels.</p><p>Короткие ответы: <b>Yes, there is.</b> / <b>No, there isn't.</b></p>"},{"stage":"Грамматика","type":"note","title":"Где это?","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th></th><th>Слова</th><th>Пример</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>in</td><td>The bed is in the bedroom.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>on</td><td>The table is on the balcony.</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>next to</td><td>The toilets are next to the gym.</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>near</td><td>Our house is near the school.</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>on the left / right</td><td>The lift is on the left.</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>upstairs / over there</td><td>The bathroom is upstairs.</td></tr></table><p><b>in</b> — внутри комнаты или города. <b>on</b> — на поверхности.</p><p><b>next to</b> — прямо рядом. <b>near</b> — недалеко.</p><p>Чтобы спросить: <b>Where's the…?</b> или <b>Where are the…?</b></p><p class=\"cp-note__fwd\">at + время будет в уроке 11.</p>"},{"stage":"Грамматика","type":"note","title":"Смотрите и слушайте.","sub":"","html":"","examples":["Where do you live?","I live in a flat in Almaty.","There's one bedroom.","There aren't any hotels.","The toilets are next to the lift.","The bathroom is upstairs."]},{"stage":"Практика","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"___ a great bakery.","options":["There are","There's","There aren't"],"keep":false,"answer":"There's","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"___ 4,000 people.","options":["There are","There's","There isn't"],"keep":false,"answer":"There are","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"___ any hotels.","options":["There isn't","There's","There aren't"],"keep":false,"answer":"There aren't","why":"Множественное + отрицание → there aren't any.","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"The bed is","after":"the bedroom.","answers":["in"],"bank":["in","next to","on"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"The table is","after":"the balcony.","answers":["on"],"bank":["in","near","on"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"The toilets are","after":"the gym.","answers":["next to"],"bank":["next to","in","upstairs"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Практика","type":"cols","title":"is или are?","sub":"","columns":["There is","There are"],"items":[{"text":"a garden","col":0},{"text":"a kitchen","col":0},{"text":"four rooms","col":1},{"text":"supermarkets","col":1},{"text":"a lift","col":0},{"text":"two bedrooms","col":1}]},{"stage":"Практика","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["big","is","kitchen.","There","a"],"answer":"There is a big kitchen.","why":""},{"stage":"Практика","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["are","Where","toilets?","the"],"answer":"Where are the toilets?","why":""},{"stage":"Практика","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["is","left.","on","lift","the","The"],"answer":"The lift is on the left.","why":""},{"stage":"Практика","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["There","is","two","bedrooms."],"bad":1,"answer":"There are two bedrooms.","why":"Два и больше → there are."},{"stage":"Практика","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["There","aren't","some","hotels."],"bad":2,"answer":"There aren't any hotels.","why":"В отрицании — any."},{"stage":"Практика","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["I","live","on","a","small","flat."],"bad":2,"answer":"I live in a small flat.","why":"Внутри жилья → in."},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/77deb3fd6752.mp3","prompt":"Что вы слышите?","options":["There are 4,000 people.","There's a great bakery.","There's a theatre."],"answer":"There's a great bakery.","html":""},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/5146e33fedf9.mp3","prompt":"Утверждение или отрицание?","options":["Positive — there are hotels.","Negative — there aren't any hotels."],"answer":"Negative — there aren't any hotels.","html":""},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","src":"/learning/audio/a0/2625f9897dc1.mp3","before":"There","after":"a theatre.","answers":["isn't"],"bank":["isn't","aren't","is"]},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/884bd68eaaed.mp3","prompt":"— Is there a hotel car park?","options":["Yes, there is.","No, there isn't.","Yes, there are."],"answer":"Yes, there is.","html":""},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/136171b9da14.mp3","prompt":"— Where are the toilets?","options":["Upstairs.","Next to the gym.","On the left."],"answer":"Next to the gym.","html":""},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/fa8c6a737b10.mp3","prompt":"Есть ли ванна?","options":["Yes, there is.","No, but there's a shower.","No, and there isn't a shower."],"answer":"No, but there's a shower.","html":""},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"note","title":"Прочитайте про Сэма.","sub":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Sam</p><p>Hi! I'm Sam. I live in a small flat in Almaty.</p><p>There's one bedroom and a big kitchen.</p><p>There isn't a garden, but there's a balcony.</p><p>The lift is next to the exit, on the left.</p>"},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Sam lives in a flat.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"True","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Sam</p><p>Hi! I'm Sam. I live in a small flat in Almaty.</p><p>There's one bedroom and a big kitchen.</p><p>There isn't a garden, but there's a balcony.</p><p>The lift is next to the exit, on the left.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"There is a garden.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"False","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Sam</p><p>Hi! I'm Sam. I live in a small flat in Almaty.</p><p>There's one bedroom and a big kitchen.</p><p>There isn't a garden, but there's a balcony.</p><p>The lift is next to the exit, on the left.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"gap","title":"Прочитайте ещё раз. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"The lift is","after":"to the exit.","answers":["next"],"bank":["in","on","next"],"why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Sam</p><p>Hi! I'm Sam. I live in a small flat in Almaty.</p><p>There's one bedroom and a big kitchen.</p><p>There isn't a garden, but there's a balcony.</p><p>The lift is next to the exit, on the left.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Аудирование","type":"choice","title":"Прочитайте ещё раз. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Сколько там спален?","options":["Two","One","Three"],"keep":false,"answer":"One","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Sam</p><p>Hi! I'm Sam. I live in a small flat in Almaty.</p><p>There's one bedroom and a big kitchen.</p><p>There isn't a garden, but there's a balcony.</p><p>The lift is next to the exit, on the left.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Говорение","type":"write","title":"Напишите о своём доме.","sub":"Что есть и чего нет.","placeholder":"","html":"<ul class=\"cp-frames\"><li>I live in ___ .</li><li>There's ___ .</li><li>There isn't ___ .</li></ul><div class=\"cp-note__chips\"><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">I live in</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">a flat</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">a house</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">There's</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">There are</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">There isn't</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">a garden</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">two bedrooms</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">a big kitchen</span></div>","modelHtml":"<ul class=\"cp-checks\"><li>После <b>live</b> я поставил(а) <b>in</b>.</li><li>Один предмет → <b>there's</b>; два и больше → <b>there are</b>.</li><li>В отрицании есть <b>isn't</b> или <b>aren't</b>.</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Говорение","type":"record","title":"Произнесите предложения. Запишите и послушайте.","sub":"Сначала послушайте каждое предложение.","items":["Where do you live?","I live in a flat in Almaty.","There's a big kitchen.","Where are the toilets?"],"itemAudio":["/learning/audio/a0/8eef4d23bc2f.mp3","/learning/audio/a0/e93afb8c8bd5.mp3","/learning/audio/a0/9ba753bac361.mp3","/learning/audio/a0/898558f997e1.mp3"]},{"stage":"Итоги","type":"checklist","title":"Урок 8 пройден","sub":"Урок 8 из 24 · Юнит 3","items":["Я могу сказать, где живу.","Я могу использовать there is и there are.","Я могу спросить, где что находится."]}]}
